# SITE-V1 permanent governance

- Read `AGENTS.md` and `docs/handover/README.md` before substantial work.
- Treat current code, tests, accepted ADRs and executable contracts as truth;
  dated handover summaries are orientation.
- Keep every commit safe for public history and preserve the private/public data
  boundary.
- Never infer factual review or authorization for transfer, commit, visibility,
  deployment or publication.
- Do not stage, commit, push, change remotes/visibility, deploy or publish unless
  Andrés explicitly authorizes that exact action.
- Keep increments small, inspect all changes and close with
  `docs/handover/checkpoint-template.md`.
